# etcd-backup Docker Image

Image for etcd backup CronJob with tools:
- etcdctl (v3.5.12)
- aws cli
- kubectl
- Common utilities (curl, jq, vim, etc.)

## Build

```bash
docker build -t ghcr.io/mohamedsabry-dev/etcd-backup:latest .
docker push ghcr.io/mohamedsabry-dev/etcd-backup:latest
```

## Usage

Used by etcd-backup CronJob in:
- kubernetes/dev/deployments/apps/etcd-backup/cronjob.yaml
- kubernetes/prod/deployments/apps/etcd-backup/cronjob.yaml
